#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:4
msgid "Training a Reach Policy for Real Robot Deployment"
msgstr "训练用于实机部署的 Reach 策略"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:6
msgid ""
"This tutorial walks you through training an end-effector pose tracking "
"(reach) reinforcement learning (RL) policy that transfers from simulation to"
" a real robot. By the end of this guide, you will have a trained policy "
"capable of controlling a robot arm to reach arbitrary target end-effector "
"poses within its workspace."
msgstr ""
"本教程介绍如何训练末端执行器位姿跟踪（Reach）强化学习（RL）策略，并从仿真迁移到真实机器人。完成后，您将得到一个能够控制机械臂、在工作空间内到达任意目标末端位姿的策略。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:8
msgid "**Supported Robots:**"
msgstr "**支持的机器人：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:10
msgid "**Universal Robots UR10e**: 6-DOF industrial robot arm"
msgstr "**Universal Robots UR10e** ：6 自由度工业机械臂"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:11
msgid "**Flexiv Rizon 4s**: 7-DOF collaborative robot arm"
msgstr "**Flexiv Rizon 4s** ：7 自由度协作机械臂"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:13
msgid "**Scope of This Tutorial:**"
msgstr "**本教程的范围：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:15
msgid ""
"This tutorial focuses on the **training** portion of the sim-to-real "
"workflow. For deployment on real hardware, including robot interface setup "
"and ROS inference node configuration, refer to the `Isaac ROS Documentation "
"<https://nvidia-isaac-"
"ros.github.io/v/release-4.6/reference_workflows/isaac_for_manipulation/index.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"本教程介绍仿真到现实工作流的 **训练** 部分。实机部署步骤，包括机器人接口设置及 ROS 推理节点配置，见 `Isaac ROS 文档 "
"<https://nvidia-isaac-"
"ros.github.io/v/release-4.6/reference_workflows/isaac_for_manipulation/index.html>`_"
" 。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:17
msgid "**Prerequisites:**"
msgstr "**前提条件：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:19
msgid ""
"Before starting this tutorial, ensure you have Isaac Lab installed and "
"configured. Follow the :ref:`installation guide <isaaclab-installation-"
"root>` if you haven't already set up your environment."
msgstr ""
"开始之前，请确保已安装并配置 Isaac Lab。如果尚未配置环境，请按 :ref:`安装指南 <isaaclab-installation-"
"root>` 操作。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:23
msgid "Task Overview"
msgstr "任务概览"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:25
msgid ""
"The reach task trains a policy to track randomly sampled end-effector poses "
"within the robot's workspace."
msgstr "Reach 任务训练策略跟踪机器人工作空间内随机采样的末端执行器位姿。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:27
msgid "**How It Works:**"
msgstr "**工作原理：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:29
msgid ""
"A target pose (position and orientation) is randomly sampled within a "
"defined workspace"
msgstr "在指定工作空间内随机采样目标位姿（位置和朝向）"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:30
msgid ""
"The policy receives the current joint states and the target pose as "
"observations"
msgstr "策略接收当前关节状态和目标位姿作为观测"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:31
msgid ""
"The policy outputs incremental joint position commands to move the end-"
"effector toward the target"
msgstr "策略输出增量关节位置指令，使末端执行器朝目标移动"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:32
msgid ""
"The target is resampled periodically during training to ensure the policy "
"generalizes across the workspace"
msgstr "训练时定期重新采样目标，让策略能泛化到整个工作空间"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:36
msgid "Key Concepts for Sim-to-Real Transfer"
msgstr "仿真到现实迁移的关键概念"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:38
msgid ""
"Successful sim-to-real transfer requires consistency across three areas:"
msgstr "成功的仿真到现实迁移需要保证三方面的一致性："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Input Consistency**: Observations available in simulation must match those"
" available on the real robot"
msgstr "**输入一致性** ：仿真中的观测必须与实机可获得的观测一致。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:41
msgid ""
"**System Response Consistency**: The simulated robot must respond to actions"
" similarly to the real robot"
msgstr "**系统响应一致性** ：仿真机器人对动作的响应应与实机相近。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Output Consistency**: Any post-processing on policy outputs must be "
"replicated during deployment"
msgstr "**输出一致性** ：部署时必须复现对策略输出进行的所有后处理。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:44
msgid ""
"When these are properly addressed, policies trained purely in simulation can"
" transfer to real hardware without any real-world training data."
msgstr "妥善处理这些问题后，仅在仿真中训练的策略也能迁移到真实硬件，无需任何实机训练数据。"

