#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:93
msgid ""
"The noise terms are set to zero by default (``Unoise(n_min=-0.0, "
"n_max=0.0)``), meaning no observation noise is applied. This can be adjusted"
" if noise modeling is desired for additional robustness. Modern robot "
"controllers provide sufficiently accurate joint state feedback that adding "
"noise during training is not required for sim-to-real transfer of this task."
msgstr ""
"噪声项默认为零（ ``Unoise(n_min=-0.0, n_max=0.0)`` "
"），即不添加观测噪声。如果希望通过噪声建模进一步提升鲁棒性，可以调整这些值。现代机器人控制器提供的关节状态反馈已足够准确，因此本任务的仿真到现实迁移不需要在训练时额外加噪声。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:97
msgid "Action Space"
msgstr "动作空间"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:99
msgid ""
"The policy outputs **incremental joint position commands**. Each action "
"specifies a delta (change) to apply to the current joint positions:"
msgstr "策略输出 **增量关节位置指令** 。每个动作指定应叠加到当前关节位置上的增量："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:0
msgid "UR10e"
msgstr "UR10e"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:0
msgid "Flexiv Rizon 4s"
msgstr "Flexiv Rizon 4s"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:125
msgid ""
"The action scale of 0.0625 radians (~3.6 degrees) per step provides a "
"balance between responsiveness and smooth motion. The UR10e uses "
"``[\".*\"]`` to match all joints, while the Rizon 4s explicitly specifies "
"``[\"joint[1-7]\"]`` to match its 7 arm joints."
msgstr ""
"每步动作缩放系数为 0.0625 弧度（约 3.6 度），兼顾响应速度和运动平滑性。UR10e 使用 ``[\".*\"]`` 匹配所有关节；Rizon"
" 4s 则显式指定 ``[\"joint[1-7]\"]`` ，匹配 7 个机械臂关节。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:127
msgid "**Action dimension:** 6 (UR10e) or 7 (Rizon 4s)"
msgstr "**动作维度：** 6（UR10e）或 7（Rizon 4s）"

