msgstr ""
"修改机器人专用配置文件（如 ``joint_pos_env_cfg.py`` ）中的 ``target_pos_centre`` 和 "
"``target_pos_range`` ："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:258
#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:276
#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:294
#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:308
msgid "**Effects:**"
msgstr "**影响：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:260
msgid "Larger ranges increase task difficulty but improve generalization"
msgstr "扩大范围会增加任务难度，但有助于提升泛化能力。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:261
msgid ""
"Ensure all target positions are reachable by the robot (within kinematic "
"limits)"
msgstr "确保所有目标位置都在机器人可达范围内（满足运动学限制）。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:262
msgid "Targets outside reachable workspace will cause the policy to fail"
msgstr "工作空间之外的目标会导致策略失败。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:264
msgid "**Target Orientation Range**"
msgstr "**目标朝向范围**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:266
msgid "Modify ``target_rot_centre`` and ``target_rot_range``:"
msgstr "修改 ``target_rot_centre`` 和 ``target_rot_range`` ："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:278
msgid ""
"Wider orientation ranges train more versatile policies but may slow "
"convergence"
msgstr "扩大朝向范围可训练适用范围更广的策略，但可能减慢收敛。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:279
msgid ""
"Very wide ranges (e.g., full rotation) significantly increase training "
"difficulty"
msgstr "范围过大（如允许任意旋转）会显著增加训练难度。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:281
msgid "**Action Scale**"
msgstr "**动作缩放系数**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:283
msgid "Modify the ``scale`` parameter in the action configuration:"
msgstr "修改动作配置中的 ``scale`` 参数："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:296
msgid "Smaller scale: Finer control, smoother motion, but slower reaching"
msgstr "系数较小：控制更精细、运动更平滑，但到达目标较慢。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:297
msgid ""
"Larger scale: Faster motion, but potentially jerky or overshooting targets"
msgstr "系数较大：运动更快，但可能出现突变或越过目标。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:298
msgid "The same scale must be used during deployment on the real robot"
msgstr "部署到实机时必须使用相同的缩放系数。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:300
msgid "**Target Resampling Interval**"
msgstr "**目标重采样间隔**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:302
msgid "Modify ``resampling_time_range`` in the commands configuration:"
msgstr "修改命令配置中的 ``resampling_time_range`` ："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:310
msgid ""
"Shorter intervals: More diverse targets per episode, but less time to "
"converge to each target"
msgstr "间隔较短：每回合能接触更多不同目标，但到达每个目标的时间更少。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:311
msgid ""
"Longer intervals: More time to refine tracking, but fewer targets seen "
"during training"
msgstr "间隔较长：有更多时间精细跟踪，但训练中接触的目标更少。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:315
msgid "Domain Randomization"
msgstr "域随机化"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:317
msgid ""
"Domain randomization helps the policy generalize across variations in real "
"robot behavior."
msgstr "域随机化有助于策略适应真实机器人行为的变化。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:319
msgid "**Actuator Gain Randomization:**"
msgstr "**执行器增益随机化：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:336
msgid ""
"The ``min_step_count_between_reset=200`` ensures that actuator gains are not"
" re-randomized too frequently, giving the policy time to adapt to each set "
"of parameters before they change."
msgstr ""
"``min_step_count_between_reset=200`` "
"可避免执行器增益过于频繁地重新随机化，让策略在参数再次变化前有时间适应当前设置。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:338
msgid "**Joint Friction Randomization:**"
msgstr "**关节摩擦随机化：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:354
msgid "**Initial Joint Position Randomization:**"
msgstr "**初始关节位置随机化：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:369
msgid "Reward Structure"
msgstr "奖励结构"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:371
msgid ""
"The policy is trained using a keypoint-based reward that captures both "
"position and orientation accuracy:"
msgstr "策略使用基于关键点的奖励进行训练，同时衡量位置和朝向精度："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:407
msgid ""
"The keypoint-based reward places virtual markers on the end-effector frame "
"and measures the distance to corresponding markers on the target frame. This"
" provides a robust metric that naturally captures both position and "
"orientation errors."
msgstr "基于关键点的奖励在末端执行器坐标系上放置虚拟标记，并测量它们与目标坐标系上对应标记之间的距离。该指标能够自然地同时反映位置和朝向误差。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:411
msgid "Training the Policy"
msgstr "训练策略"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:414
msgid "Step 1: Verify the Environment"
msgstr "步骤 1：验证环境"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:416
msgid ""
"Before starting full training, launch a quick visualization run to verify "
"the environment is set up correctly:"
msgstr "开始完整训练前，先短暂运行一次可视化，确认环境配置正确："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:0
msgid "uv (Recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:0
msgid "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"
msgstr "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:464
msgid ""
"This opens the Isaac Sim viewer where you can observe the training in real-"
"time."
msgstr "这会打开 Isaac Sim 查看器，让您实时观察训练。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:466
msgid "Reach policy training visualization in Isaac Lab"
msgstr "Isaac Lab 中的 Reach 策略训练可视化"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:471
msgid ""
"Training visualization showing multiple parallel environments with robots "
"reaching toward target poses."
msgstr "训练可视化展示多个并行环境中的机器人向目标位姿移动。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:473
msgid "**What to look for:**"
msgstr "**检查要点：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:475
msgid "The robot should be moving its arm attempting to reach different poses"
msgstr "机器人应移动机械臂，尝试到达不同位姿。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:476
msgid ""
"Early on, motion will be erratic as the policy explores; this is expected"
msgstr "训练初期策略正在探索，运动不规则是正常现象。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:477
msgid ""
"For **Rizon 4s**: Target pose markers appear as coordinate frames in the "
"scene"
msgstr "对于 **Rizon 4s** ：目标位姿标记以坐标系形式显示在场景中。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:478
msgid ""
"For **UR10e**: Target visualization is disabled (``debug_vis = False``) "
"because commands are generated in the ``base`` frame, which is 180 degrees "
"offset from the ``base_link`` frame used for rendering. The robot will still"
" track targets, but markers won't be visible."
msgstr ""
"对于 **UR10e** ：目标可视化已关闭（ ``debug_vis = False`` ），因为命令在 ``base`` "
"坐标系中生成，而它与渲染使用的 ``base_link`` 坐标系相差 180 度。机器人仍会跟踪目标，但不会显示标记。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:480
msgid ""
"Once you confirm the environment looks correct, stop training with "
"``Ctrl+C`` and proceed to full-scale training."
msgstr "确认环境显示正确后，按 ``Ctrl+C`` 停止训练，再开始完整规模的训练。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:484
msgid "Step 2: Full-Scale Training"
msgstr "步骤 2：完整规模训练"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:486
msgid "Launch full training with many parallel environments in headless mode:"
msgstr "在无界面模式下，使用大量并行环境启动完整训练："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:534
msgid "**Command breakdown:**"
msgstr "**命令说明：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:536
msgid ""
"``--num_envs 4096``: Runs 4096 parallel environments for efficient data "
"collection"
msgstr "``--num_envs 4096`` ：运行 4096 个并行环境，高效采集数据。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:537
msgid "``--video``: Records videos to monitor training progress"
msgstr "``--video`` ：录制视频，便于观察训练进展。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:538
msgid ""
"``--video_length 720``: Each video captures exactly one full episode "
"(``episode_length_s / (sim.dt * decimation)`` = ``12.0 / (1/120 * 2)`` = 720"
" steps)"
msgstr ""
"``--video_length 720`` ：每段视频恰好覆盖一个完整回合（ ``episode_length_s / (sim.dt * "
"decimation)`` = ``12.0 / (1/120 * 2)`` = 720 步）。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:539
msgid ""
"``--video_interval 72000``: Records a video every 72000 environment steps "
"(~every 100 training iterations)."
msgstr "``--video_interval 72000`` ：每 72000 个环境步（约每 100 次训练迭代）录制一段视频。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:541
msgid "**Training Configuration:**"
msgstr "**训练配置：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:543
msgid "The training hyperparameters are the same for both robots:"
msgstr "两个机器人使用相同的训练超参数："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:579
msgid ""
"The ``experiment_name`` is ``\"reach_ur10e\"`` for UR10e and "
"``\"reach_rizon4s\"`` for Rizon 4s. Training typically takes 1-3 hours "
"depending on your GPU."
msgstr ""
"UR10e 的 ``experiment_name`` 为 ``\"reach_ur10e\"`` ，Rizon 4s 的为 "
"``\"reach_rizon4s\"`` 。训练通常需要 1–3 小时，具体取决于 GPU。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:583
msgid "Step 3: Monitor Training Progress"
msgstr "步骤 3：监控训练进展"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:585
msgid "Use TensorBoard to monitor training metrics:"
msgstr "使用 TensorBoard 监控训练指标："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:621
msgid ""
"Replace the log directory path with your actual training log location if "
"different."
msgstr "如果训练日志位置不同，请将日志目录路径改为实际位置。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:623
msgid "**Key metrics to watch:**"
msgstr "**主要观察指标：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:625
msgid ""
"**Mean reward**: Should increase steadily and plateau once the policy "
"converges"
msgstr "**平均奖励** ：应持续增长，并在策略收敛后趋于平稳。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:626
msgid ""
"**Reward terms**: Monitor individual reward components to understand policy "
"behavior:"
msgstr "**奖励项** ：观察各个奖励分量，以了解策略行为："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:628
msgid ""
"``end_effector_keypoint_tracking``: Linear keypoint tracking penalty -- "
"should become less negative as the policy improves"
msgstr ""
"``end_effector_keypoint_tracking`` ：线性关键点跟踪惩罚，随着策略改善，应逐渐接近零（负值的绝对值减小）。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:629
msgid ""
"``end_effector_keypoint_tracking_exp``: Exponential precision reward -- "
"should increase as the policy achieves finer tracking"
msgstr "``end_effector_keypoint_tracking_exp`` ：指数精度奖励，随着跟踪精度提高，应逐渐增大。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:630
msgid ""
"``action_rate`` and ``action``: Motion smoothness penalties -- these are "
"small in magnitude but should increase (become less negative) over training,"
" indicating the policy is converging toward smoother motion"
msgstr ""
"``action_rate`` 和 ``action`` ：运动平滑性惩罚，数值较小，但训练中应逐渐增大（负值接近零），表明策略正收敛到更平滑的运动。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:632
msgid ""
"**Position error**: Tracks the Euclidean distance (in meters) between the "
"end-effector and target position -- should decrease over training"
msgstr "**位置误差** ：末端执行器与目标位置之间的欧氏距离，单位为米，应随训练减小。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:633
msgid ""
"**Orientation error**: Tracks the angular difference between the end-"
"effector and target orientation -- should decrease over training"
msgstr "**朝向误差** ：末端执行器与目标朝向之间的角度差，应随训练减小。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:637
msgid "Step 4: Evaluate the Trained Policy"
msgstr "步骤 4：评估已训练策略"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:639
msgid ""
"Once training completes, evaluate the policy with the play command. The play"
" command automatically applies the task's play-mode overrides "
"(``play_mode``), which disable observation corruption for cleaner evaluation"
" and cap the number of environments for better visualization:"
msgstr ""
"训练完成后，用回放命令评估策略。回放命令会自动应用任务的回放模式覆盖设置（ ``play_mode`` "
"），关闭观测扰动以便更清楚地评估，并限制环境数量以改善可视化："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:690
msgid "**Checkpoint Loading:**"
msgstr "**加载检查点：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:692
msgid ""
"By default, the play command automatically loads the most recent checkpoint "
"from the most recent training run. It searches in "
"``logs/rsl_rl/<experiment_name>/`` and selects the latest run folder and "
"checkpoint file (sorted alphabetically)."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，回放命令会自动加载最新训练运行中的最新检查点。它在 ``logs/rsl_rl/<experiment_name>/`` "
"中搜索，按字母顺序排序后选择最后一个运行文件夹和检查点文件。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:696
msgid "To load a specific checkpoint, use these arguments:"
msgstr "要加载指定检查点，使用以下参数："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:721
msgid "Step 5: Deploy on Real Robot"
msgstr "步骤 5：部署到真实机器人"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:723
msgid ""
"Once satisfied with the trained policy, deploy it on real hardware using the"
" Isaac ROS deployment pipeline. The pipeline uses:"
msgstr "确认训练效果符合预期后，通过 Isaac ROS 部署流水线部署到真实硬件。该流水线使用："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:725
msgid "The trained model checkpoint (``.pt`` file)"
msgstr "训练得到的模型检查点（ ``.pt`` 文件）"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:726
msgid ""
"The ``agent.yaml`` and ``env.yaml`` configuration files generated during "
"training"
msgstr "训练时生成的 ``agent.yaml`` 和 ``env.yaml`` 配置文件"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:728
msgid "No additional export step is required."
msgstr "无需额外的导出步骤。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:730
msgid ""
"For detailed deployment instructions, see the `Isaac ROS Documentation "
"<https://nvidia-isaac-"
"ros.github.io/v/release-4.6/reference_workflows/isaac_for_manipulation/index.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"详细部署步骤见 `Isaac ROS 文档 <https://nvidia-isaac-"
"ros.github.io/v/release-4.6/reference_workflows/isaac_for_manipulation/index.html>`_"
" 。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:734
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:737
msgid "CUDA Out of Memory"
msgstr "CUDA 内存不足"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:739
msgid "**Error:**"
msgstr "**错误：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:745
msgid "**Solutions:**"
msgstr "**解决办法：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:747
msgid "**Reduce parallel environments:**"
msgstr "**减少并行环境数量：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:753
msgid "**Disable video recording:**"
msgstr "**关闭视频录制：**"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:755
msgid "Remove the ``--video`` flags to free GPU memory."
msgstr "移除 ``--video`` 参数，以释放 GPU 显存。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:758
msgid "Policy Does Not Converge"
msgstr "策略不收敛"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:760
msgid "If rewards do not improve after many iterations:"
msgstr "如果经过多次迭代奖励仍没有改善："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:762
msgid ""
"**Check target workspace ranges**: Ensure all target poses are reachable by "
"the robot"
msgstr "**检查目标工作空间范围** ：确保所有目标位姿都能被机器人到达。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:763
msgid ""
"**Verify joint names**: Confirm joint ordering matches between simulation "
"and configuration"
msgstr "**核对关节名称** ：确认仿真与配置中的关节顺序一致。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:764
msgid ""
"**Reduce domain randomization**: Temporarily disable randomization to verify"
" the base task works"
msgstr "**减小域随机化** ：暂时关闭随机化，确认基础任务能正常运行。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:767
msgid "Jerky Motion on Real Robot"
msgstr "实机运动不平滑"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:769
msgid "If the deployed policy produces jerky or unstable motion:"
msgstr "如果部署后的策略产生突变或不稳定运动："

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:771
msgid ""
"**Reduce action scale**: Lower the ``scale`` parameter in "
"``RelativeJointPositionActionCfg``"
msgstr "**减小动作缩放系数** ：降低 ``RelativeJointPositionActionCfg`` 中的 ``scale`` 参数。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:772
msgid ""
"**Verify control frequency**: Ensure the real robot runs at the same "
"frequency as simulation (60 Hz by default)"
msgstr "**核对控制频率** ：确保实机与仿真的运行频率相同（默认为 60 Hz）。"

#: source/policy_deployment/04_reach/reach_policy.rst:773
msgid ""
"**Check joint ordering**: Verify joint names and ordering match between "
"simulation and real robot"
msgstr "**核对关节顺序** ：确认仿真与实机的关节名称和顺序一致。"

